{"case_id": "C04", "meeting_id": "ES2002b", "series": "ES2002", "language": "en", "source": "AMI_1.6.2", "meeting_date": "13-12-04", "segments": [{"id": "ES2002b.B.dialog-act.dharshi.14", "start_ms": 104740, "end_ms": 114790, "speaker": "B", "speaker_name": "Project Manager", "person_ref": "FEE005", "text": "which is the The first one is that um uh the company's decided that teletext is outdated uh because of how popular the internet is."}, {"id": "ES2002b.B.dialog-act.dharshi.15", "start_ms": 114790, "end_ms": 116980, "speaker": "B", "speaker_name": "Project Manager", "person_ref": "FEE005", "text": "Nobody uses teletext very much anymore,"}, {"id": "ES2002b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.5", "start_ms": 116750, "end_ms": 116990, "speaker": "D", "speaker_name": "Marketing Expert", "person_ref": "MEE008", "text": "'Kay."}, {"id": "ES2002b.B.dialog-act.dharshi.16", "start_ms": 116980, "end_ms": 121940, "speaker": "B", "speaker_name": "Project Manager", "person_ref": "FEE005", "text": "so we don't really need to consider that in the functionality of the of the remote control."}], "participants": [{"speaker": "A", "speaker_name": "Industrial Designer", "person_ref": "MEE006"}, {"speaker": "B", "speaker_name": "Project Manager", "person_ref": "FEE005"}, {"speaker": "C", "speaker_name": "User Interface Designer", "person_ref": "MEE007"}, {"speaker": "D", "speaker_name": "Marketing Expert", "person_ref": "MEE008"}]}
{"case_id": "C05", "meeting_id": "ES2002b", "series": "ES2002", "language": "en", "source": "AMI_1.6.2", "meeting_date": "13-12-04", "segments": [{"id": "ES2002b.B.dialog-act.dharshi.17", "start_ms": 121940, "end_ms": 130690, "speaker": "B", "speaker_name": "Project Manager", "person_ref": "FEE005", "text": "Um they've also suggested that we um we only use the remote control to control the television, not the V_C_R_, D_V_D_ or anything else."}, {"id": "ES2002b.B.dialog-act.dharshi.18", "start_ms": 130690, "end_ms": 141680, "speaker": "B", "speaker_name": "Project Manager", "person_ref": "FEE005", "text": "I think the worry is that if the project becomes too complex then it'll affect um how long it takes us to get it into into production, the time to market."}, {"id": "ES2002b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.6", "start_ms": 141270, "end_ms": 141590, "speaker": "D", "speaker_name": "Marketing Expert", "person_ref": "MEE008", "text": "Okay."}, {"id": "ES2002b.B.dialog-act.dharshi.19", "start_ms": 141680, "end_ms": 145410, "speaker": "B", "speaker_name": "Project Manager", "person_ref": "FEE005", "text": "So um, we're just gonna keep it simple and it'll just control the T_V_."}], "participants": [{"speaker": "A", "speaker_name": "Industrial Designer", "person_ref": "MEE006"}, {"speaker": "B", "speaker_name": "Project Manager", "person_ref": "FEE005"}, {"speaker": "C", "speaker_name": "User Interface Designer", "person_ref": "MEE007"}, {"speaker": "D", "speaker_name": "Marketing Expert", "person_ref": "MEE008"}]}
