{"case_id": "C13", "meeting_id": "ES2004d", "series": "ES2004", "language": "en", "source": "AMI_1.6.2", "meeting_date": "19-01-05", "segments": [{"id": "ES2004d.C.dialog-act.vkaraisk.248", "start_ms": 1738960, "end_ms": 1742270, "speaker": "C", "speaker_name": "Industrial Designer", "person_ref": "MEE014", "text": "yeah, I I feel that everyone was listened to"}, {"id": "ES2004d.C.dialog-act.vkaraisk.249", "start_ms": 1742270, "end_ms": 1748930, "speaker": "C", "speaker_name": "Industrial Designer", "person_ref": "MEE014", "text": "and all the points that were raised seem to have been sorted out,"}, {"id": "ES2004d.C.dialog-act.vkaraisk.250", "start_ms": 1748930, "end_ms": 1751580, "speaker": "C", "speaker_name": "Industrial Designer", "person_ref": "MEE014", "text": "although we didn't quite make the voice recognition in there,"}, {"id": "ES2004d.C.dialog-act.vkaraisk.251", "start_ms": 1751580, "end_ms": 1753660, "speaker": "C", "speaker_name": "Industrial Designer", "person_ref": "MEE014", "text": "but that's that's good."}, {"id": "ES2004d.B.dialog-act.vkaraisk.230", "start_ms": 1753180, "end_ms": 1753630, "speaker": "B", "speaker_name": "Project Manager", "person_ref": "FEE013", "text": "Yeah."}, {"id": "ES2004d.C.dialog-act.vkaraisk.253", "start_ms": 1753660, "end_ms": 1766870, "speaker": "C", "speaker_name": "Industrial Designer", "person_ref": "MEE014", "text": "I think it would have made it into the final product if it was actually if if if we'd seen the marketing before the initial specification was put out, I think maybe it would've come out a d little different,"}], "participants": [{"speaker": "A", "speaker_name": "User Interface Designer", "person_ref": "MEO015"}, {"speaker": "B", "speaker_name": "Project Manager", "person_ref": "FEE013"}, {"speaker": "C", "speaker_name": "Industrial Designer", "person_ref": "MEE014"}, {"speaker": "D", "speaker_name": "Marketing Expert", "person_ref": "FEE016"}]}
{"case_id": "C19", "meeting_id": "VC127", "series": "VC509033656", "language": "zh", "source": "VCSum", "meeting_date": null, "segments": [{"id": "vc.127.34.0", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null, "speaker": "1", "speaker_name": null, "person_ref": null, "text": "谢谢徐校长。"}, {"id": "vc.127.34.1", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null, "speaker": "1", "speaker_name": null, "person_ref": null, "text": "那因为时间关系，我们后面还有蛮多问题，就没办法在这边一请两位老师解答，我们会后再把问题整理好，再请两位老师我们再把它整理成文字稿，我们会后再基金会的公众号再向大家做一个发布。"}, {"id": "vc.127.34.2", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null, "speaker": "1", "speaker_name": null, "person_ref": null, "text": "好，那最后一点点时间，我们确实时间非常的宝贵，想跟大家说的很多我们品格环节，就要在这个地方做一个告一个段落。"}]}
{"case_id": "C20", "meeting_id": "VC136", "series": "VC675505279", "language": "zh", "source": "VCSum", "meeting_date": null, "segments": [{"id": "vc.136.166.1", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null, "speaker": "1", "speaker_name": null, "person_ref": null, "text": "好，那今天就再到这，再次感谢各位教授，然后彭这个老老师的一个支持。"}, {"id": "vc.136.166.2", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null, "speaker": "1", "speaker_name": null, "person_ref": null, "text": "然后今天我们的线上研究会就到这里，然后后面的话我们会把这个视频剪辑，然后给大家确认，然后还有这个文稿可以吧。"}, {"id": "vc.136.166.3", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null, "speaker": "1", "speaker_name": null, "person_ref": null, "text": "好嘞。"}]}
{"case_id": "C21", "meeting_id": "VC178", "series": "VC981201568", "language": "zh", "source": "VCSum", "meeting_date": null, "segments": [{"id": "vc.178.27.0", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null, "speaker": "6", "speaker_name": null, "person_ref": null, "text": "对，然后意见都非常宝贵，我们会整理出来。"}, {"id": "vc.178.27.1", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null, "speaker": "6", "speaker_name": null, "person_ref": null, "text": "我觉得我们因为早上我也跟那个现在的这个新院长在聊这个话题，因为大家都觉得要讲的话很多，现在已经快 6 点了，沉淀下来你又觉得很长是吧？"}]}
{"case_id": "C24", "meeting_id": "VC130", "series": "VC497912676", "language": "zh", "source": "VCSum", "meeting_date": null, "segments": [{"id": "vc.130.21.0", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null, "speaker": "2", "speaker_name": null, "person_ref": null, "text": "每次到开学以后，微信群使用的那个频率越来越高，我都会听到老师们这么说，园长人事部门要我们确认每个孩子的信息，我把孩子的信息发到群里，让家长核对可以吗？"}, {"id": "vc.130.21.1", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null, "speaker": "2", "speaker_name": null, "person_ref": null, "text": "园长儿童体质健康彻查的结果能发在群里让家长看吗？"}]}
{"case_id": "C25", "meeting_id": "VC102", "series": "VC415021211", "language": "zh", "source": "VCSum", "meeting_date": null, "segments": [{"id": "vc.102.1.4", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null, "speaker": "2", "speaker_name": null, "person_ref": null, "text": "然后我们也以集团的形式做整个项目的投资，有集团基金，那也欢迎现场有优质项目的朋友来，可以会后跟我联系。"}, {"id": "vc.102.1.5", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null, "speaker": "2", "speaker_name": null, "person_ref": null, "text": "然后也希望就是有优质的投资机构，大家一起来孵化更多的项目，谢谢。"}]}
{"case_id": "C26", "meeting_id": "VC230", "series": "VC249377054", "language": "zh", "source": "VCSum", "meeting_date": null, "segments": [{"id": "vc.230.106.3", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null, "speaker": "9", "speaker_name": null, "person_ref": null, "text": "那接下来我们可以解决是说面向业务用户的这个界面化的沉淀，所以就是我理解在您的这个场景里面。"}, {"id": "vc.230.106.4", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null, "speaker": "9", "speaker_name": null, "person_ref": null, "text": "我们可以在会后稍后稍微落地和细化一下这个场景。"}]}
{"case_id": "C29", "meeting_id": "VC91", "series": "VC294580511", "language": "zh", "source": "VCSum", "meeting_date": null, "segments": [{"id": "vc.91.112.1", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null, "speaker": "3", "speaker_name": null, "person_ref": null, "text": "因为这个时间关系，我们叶老师这个环节我们就不组织这个讨论了。"}, {"id": "vc.91.112.2", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null, "speaker": "3", "speaker_name": null, "person_ref": null, "text": "然后如果大家有需要的话，可以在会后和叶老师再继续的讨论。"}, {"id": "vc.91.112.3", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null, "speaker": "3", "speaker_name": null, "person_ref": null, "text": "那么下面我把这个交给安老师。"}]}
{"case_id": "C30", "meeting_id": "VC215", "series": "VC382745661", "language": "zh", "source": "VCSum", "meeting_date": null, "segments": [{"id": "vc.215.87.2", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null, "speaker": "4", "speaker_name": null, "person_ref": null, "text": "然后也感谢大家参与这次的梦幻联动。"}, {"id": "vc.215.87.3", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null, "speaker": "4", "speaker_name": null, "person_ref": null, "text": "然后稍后我们会在展厅里面设置导览的环节，大家如有兴趣的话可以在美术馆的前沿墙处，然后等待导览员。"}, {"id": "vc.215.87.4", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null, "speaker": "4", "speaker_name": null, "person_ref": null, "text": "然后导览员会带大家一起去看一下雪冰老师在红砖美术馆的这次雪冰艺术卡片线的展览。"}]}
